description	"Queen Talia

A frontline tactician leading the defense of Onderon. She uses a high-utility kit to sustain allies and disrupt enemy positions.

^2Weaponry:
- Royal Defender (Pistol 3)
-- Cripples On Hit
-- 10% Less Damage/FP Drain, 20% Faster RoF
- Onderonian Vibrosword (Blue Style)
-- Low Damage, Disarms, Cripples
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- No Blaster Defense/Deflect
- Pulse Grenades (2)
- Spotting Flare (2)
-- Frag Grenade, Huge Radius
-- 0 Damage, Tracks
- Royal Armament (E-11 1)
-- 50% Less Damage, 40% More FP Drain, 100% Lower RoF, Mag Reload, Cant Be Disarmed
-- Inflicts Flashbang Effect, Slippery, Force Focus, Poison, Cripple And Tracking

^8Attributes:
- Rally
- Dodge (3)
- Tracking Beacon
- Stamina (3)
- Healing (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Anti-Mind Trick (1)
- Ally Stat Viewer

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS2]
- DNA Scrambler (Tracking Darts 6) ^3[CS4]
- On Ally Hit, Heals Over Time
- On Enemy Hit, Blinds
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Flipkick (1) ^3[CONTACT JUMP]
- Bio-Engineered Nano-Bots (Health/Armor Dispenser 2) ^3[USE In MELEE]"
